{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06095","headline":"东谿玩月 · 王维","name":"东谿玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月从断山口，遥吐柴门端。\n万木分空霁，流阴中夜攒。\n光连虚象白，气与风露寒。\n谷静秋泉响，岩深青霭残。\n清灯入幽梦，破影抱空峦。\n恍惚琴窗里，松谿晓思难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}